msgid "⟪k:0⟫Heads went rolling off shoulders, hot geysers of blood spewing from open necks."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les têtes roulaient sur les épaules, des jets de sang chaud giclaient des nuques ouvertes."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8A6725FA_ED3A_4AB9_B00A_A3D3D530FFC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29b8aba395539704bb770bcb886790dc2a378f3632e6d612d16c73f0584bfde1
