msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fire inside me still burned white hot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le feu qui me consumait brûlait encore à plein."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4D713BB_E59C_4DCF_BA27_FDFA501C1E05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
