msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E14A007_20AC_4A61_97F4_1B3027DA0750"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her god did not supply her with an endless store of bread and wine, either. ⟪k:1⟫In the end, "
"any endeavor, no matter the intentions, requires money."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Son dieu ne lui fournissait pas de pain et de vin en quantité illimitée. ⟪k:1⟫Au bout du "
"compte, n’importe quelle entreprise, quelles que soient ses intentions, nécessite de l’argent."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EABAD2BF_4D3A_4694_B1C7_4EFD0D32A5E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3447200cc1ca34f731e69930c12e460198c56c0a64c4d4c0476c2122ffb91f3c
