msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...If you think I’m going back to being a slave, you’re fooling yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Si vous pensez pouvoir me faire redevenir esclave, vous vous trompez."

#: scenario8:scenario8_99930418_4029_4EE8_B392_D46007253786
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
