msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_99930418_4029_4EE8_B392_D46007253786"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pfft. I don’t need any more damn slaves, and I certainly don’t want ⟪k:2⟫you⟪k:3⟫ as "
"one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pfft. J’ai pas besoin de plus d’esclaves, ces crétins, et j’ai certainement pas besoin "
"de ⟪k:2⟫toi⟪k:3⟫ pour ça."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FC5AE4D6_9F44_4BAC_94E2_8370524322F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b707ef6e70d5cc91f426c05a838bacd91501f4590063f210169849579a3bb76f
