msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A9315A6_A2DF_4804_8BCB_58932D32646F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Isn’t it comical, then, that you would choose God’s sacred house to stretch your legs "
"in, you filthy dog?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Donc, tu trouves pas ça ironique, toi, qu’un sale chien comme toi choisisse la maison "
"sacrée de Dieu pour se dégourdir les pattes ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4FF8CAF7_22A8_4DA5_BA99_AE5B77AC77FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88837702af98a41a4f3a82a11df0a76d1c7b560388db8d083574299206999d8a
#. default-sha256: 80035b86bb3a4400e129e06fe0b9abcb72ea2741c27d5af917c4f77cb82aee42
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4FF8CAF7_22A8_4DA5_BA99_AE5B77AC77FB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I thought ⟪k:2⟫that⟪k:3⟫ would get a reaction out of you,⟪k:4⟫but it seems you’ve got "
"no bite in you today.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Never mind, let’s get down to business."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je pensais que ça au moins, ça te ferait réagir,⟪k:2⟫mais il semblerait qu’tu aies "
"perdu tout ton mordant.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Peu importe, parlons affaires."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3F0855F2_B032_4EC8_B082_A6EDEE7BE205
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0dc753e324eadb8d398cd46e8767af1060636fd713617a708fbdaebb3bf6ce4
